msgstr "Chatte mit Wander"

#: ai/templates/ai/chat.html:393
msgid ""
"Tell me what kind of trip you're thinking about - dates, budget, climate, "
"anything."
msgstr "Erzähl mir, an welche Art von Reise du denkst - Daten, Budget, Klima, alles."

